## Utility

Utility: Governance
Deskripsi: ETHFI token digunakan untuk voting on-chain melalui EtherFi DAO (Governor + Timelock) — proposal parameter protokol, treasury management, protocol upgrade, fee switch activation
Status: Live
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Governance, https://docs.ether.fi/governance]; (HIGH) [Snapshot EtherFi, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]; (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Token, https://docs.ether.fi/token/ethfi]

Utility: Fee Accrual (Fee Switch)
Deskripsi: Governance proposal (EV-024 2024-10) untuk mengaktifkan fee switch — protocol revenue (staking fee, restaking fee, vault fee, bridging fee) sebagian dialokasikan ke ETHFI token holder/staker
Status: Planned / Governance Proposal (outcome perlu verifikasi di Snapshot)
Sources: (MEDIUM) [Snapshot EtherFi, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog, https://blog.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EV-024 dari Phase 3 History]

Utility: Incentive Alignment
Deskripsi: Token digunakan untuk incentive alignment antara staker, operator, dan protokol — reward distribution, liquidity mining, ecosystem grants
Status: Live (ecosystem incentives ongoing)
Sources: (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Docs Token, https://docs.ether.fi/token/ethfi]; (MEDIUM) [EtherFi Blog, https://blog.ether.fi]; (MEDIUM) [EigenLayer Docs, https://docs.eigenlayer.xyz; Symbiotic Docs, https://docs.symbiotic.fi]

Utility: Staking (Token Staking untuk Governance Weight)
Deskripsi: ETHFI dapat di-stake untuk mendapatkan voting power (veETHFI atau mekanisme serupa) — detail implementasi staking token tidak dipublikasikan secara teknis lengkap
Status: Planned / Live (perlu verifikasi apakah staking contract sudah deployed)
