## Governance

Governance Model: On-chain DAO Governance (Governor + Timelock) — token-weighted voting, proposal execution via timelock
Voting System: Token-weighted voting (1 ETHFI = 1 vote) — snapshot off-chain signaling + on-chain execution
Voting Power: ETHFI token balance pada snapshot block — delegasi voting power didukung
Delegation: Supported — token holder dapat mendelegasikan voting power ke alamat lain (delegate)
Proposal System: EtherFi DAO Governor contract — proposal creation, voting period, execution via Timelock (minimal 2 hari delay)
Treasury Governance: DAO mengelola treasury melalui Governor + Timelock — multi-sig signers tidak dipublikasikan
Status: Live sejak 2024-03 (post-TGE)
Sources: (HIGH) [EtherFi Docs Governance, https://docs.ether.fi/governance]; (HIGH) [Snapshot EtherFi, https://snapshot.org/#/etherfi.eth]; (HIGH) [Etherscan Governor Contract, https://etherscan.io/address/ (perlu identifikasi address Governor resmi)]; (MEDIUM) [EV-017, EV-020, EV-024 dari Phase 3 History]

